<title>USA: Dorsey Trailer Inc Q1 loss widens.</title>
<headline>Dorsey Trailer Inc Q1 loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>DORSEY TRAILERS, INC.</p>
<p>							     3 mos. ended</p>
<p>						     3/29/97	3/30/96</p>
<p>				 (In thousands except per share data)</p>
<p> Net sales					 $ 40,961    $ 41,028</p>
<p> Provision for plant closing			 48	   242</p>
<p> Loss from operations			   (5,161)     (1,995)</p>
<p> Credit for income taxes			  (200)	 (800)</p>
<p> Net loss					   (5,478)     (1,280)</p>
<p> Net loss per share				(1.10)	 (.26)</p>
<p> Avg shrs					     4,977	 4,937</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 Q1 includes a charge of $3.3 million from loss or expected loss on selling certain used trailers and a writeoff of $300,000 related to a new credit line.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
